 "mapping": {
  "author": "claude-mapper-M2",
  "date": "2026-11-17",
  "draft_py": "# Grow from the Ashes: \"Kicker {2}. Search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the\n# battlefield, then shuffle. If this spell was kicked, instead search your library for two basic\n# land cards, put them onto the battlefield, then shuffle.\"\n# The compiler's KickerAbility is kept. ZNR's kicker \"instead\" (B6-kicker-instead-prefix,\n# Bloodchief's Thirst): Conditional(WAS_KICKED, then=<kicked>, else=<unkicked>). Each branch is M21\n# Fabled Passage's SEARCH of a basic land card (FAnd(SUPERTYPE_EQ Basic, TYPE_EQ Land)) onto the\n# battlefield and SHUFFLE, without \"tapped\"; the kicked branch finds two. SEARCH leaves out the\n# controller role (MAPPER_GUIDE, D12).\nbasic_land = FAnd(children=(\n    FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.SUPERTYPE_EQ, string_value='Basic'),\n    FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.TYPE_EQ, string_value='Land'),\n))\n\n\ndef fetch(n):\n    return Seq(steps=(\n        A(Verb.SEARCH, {\n            'cards': Selector(\n                count=QConst(value=n),\n                mode=SelectorMode.CHOOSE,\n                filter=basic_land,\n                zones=(Zone(kind=ZoneKind.LIBRARY, controller=ControllerRef.YOU),),\n            ),\n            'destination': Zone(kind=ZoneKind.BATTLEFIELD, controller=ControllerRef.YOU),\n        }),\n        A(Verb.SHUFFLE, {'zone': Zone(kind=ZoneKind.LIBRARY, controller=ControllerRef.YOU)}),\n    ))\n\n\nkicker = compiled[0]\nabilities = [\n    kicker,\n    SpellAbility(\n        kind=SpellKind.SORCERY,\n        effect=Conditional(\n            pred=FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.WAS_KICKED),\n            then_effect=fetch(2),\n            else_effect=fetch(1),\n        ),\n    ),\n]\n",
  "clauses": [
   {
    "clause": "Kicker {2}",
    "ir": "abilities[0]"
   },
   {
    "clause": "Search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.",
    "ir": "abilities[1].effect.else_effect"
   },
   {
    "clause": "If this spell was kicked, instead search your library for two basic land cards, put them onto the battlefield, then shuffle.",
    "ir": "abilities[1].effect (pred WAS_KICKED), abilities[1].effect.then_effect"
   }
  ],
  "g0_warnings": [
   "MTGJSON keywords with no Keyword atom (check how the tree expresses them): ['KICKER']"
  ],
  "notes": "The compiler's KickerAbility is kept; the effect is ZNR's kicker 'instead' (Bloodchief's Thirst): Conditional(WAS_KICKED, then=two basics, else=one basic), each a Fabled Passage SEARCH (FAnd(SUPERTYPE_EQ Basic, TYPE_EQ Land)) onto the battlefield untapped, then SHUFFLE. G0 warns that MTGJSON KICKER has no Keyword atom, as for every compiled ZNR kicker card (KickerAbility carries it). The probe library holds no basic land. Packs: tools/scenarios/mapped/FDN/grow_from_the_ashes_*.json."
 },
